  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to support institutional, policy and capacity building to parliamentary institutions &#x2013; National Assembly and ZHoR &#x2013; to ensure effective and gender responsive legislative and budget review and oversight, with informed public participation. The support will also address the demand side by ensuring that citizen groups including those involving women, youth, elderly and persons with disabilities, research and academic institutions are empowered to input into and influence the wor</narrative>
